@startuml
!include style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 190

participant ":EqmManager" as Manager
participant ":LoanHandler" as Handler
participant ":EquipmentHandler" as Inventory

Manager -> Handler: viewLoanHistory("history id/001")
activate Handler
Handler -> Handler: getLoanHistory(input)
activate Handler
note right of Handler
Validate the command and Item ID.
end note
Handler -> Inventory: getEquipmentList()
Inventory --> Handler: current inventory
note right of Handler
findEquipment("001") requires one match.
Use that item's permanent record ID.
end note
loop each managed loan
    Handler -> Handler: select matching Item ID AND record ID
end
Handler -> Handler: sort selected copy by issue date, then loan ID
Handler --> Handler: List.copyOf(history)
deactivate Handler
alt selected history is empty
    Handler -> Handler: print empty-history message
else selected history contains loans
    Handler -> Handler: printLoans(history)
end
opt returned loans for this Item ID have no permanent identity
    Handler -> Handler: print omission note directing user to list loans
end
Handler --> Manager: display completed
deactivate Handler
note over Manager, Inventory
No records are reordered or changed. No storage calls occur.
end note
@enduml
